  "description": {
   "en": "Half a century ago, the Cosmic Demon Delekacon was sealed away, averting Earth's destruction! And now, Pec - the demon's left eye known as Eye Boy - is living it up as a permanent freeloader with his best friend Keigo?! A groundbreaking 79-page one-shot mixing youth, sci-fi, and friendship!",
   "ja": "半世紀前、宇宙魔神デレカコンは封印され、地球滅亡は回避された！そして現在、魔神の左目・アイボーイのペクは親友のケイゴと終わりなきニート生活を満喫していて!?超新感覚！青春ＳＦ友情譚読切79Ｐ!!"
